   - Components in src/components/ui/ come from shadcn-vue (MIT) and reka-ui (MIT).

5. Files copied from the owner's old site (provenance: "from the owner's old site")
   - Partner logos in public/partners/ (webp, resized): detexi, dinkes, kawalcorona (Ethical Hacker Indonesia),
